        "16ab149a-fb4a-4bb4-8938-e96861cff1a9": {
          "type": "text",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "title": "<p>Custom: <strong>Special Description</strong></p>"
          }
        },
        "description": {
          "type": "description",
          "settings": {
            "read_more": true,
            "style": "accordions",
            "title_1": "Benefits",
            "raw_content_1": "<p><strong>The Original Bond Builder </strong><br>The only patented system to noticeably repair extreme damage—turn dry, brittle hair into soft, shiny, and more resilient hair.</p><p><strong>Olaplex works to repair broken bonds.</strong><br>Patented active chemistry works on a molecular level. <i>Bis-Aminopropyl Diglycol Dimaleate</i>, a single molecule, dramatically improves the hair strength, protects from within, and provides immediate results for all hair types.</p><p><strong>BENEFITS</strong></p><ul>\n<li>Fast, 3 minute pre-shampoo treatment</li>\n<li>Immediately softer, stronger hair</li>\n<li>Repairs all types of damage in all hair types; protein-free</li>\n<li>Reduces future breakage for length retention over time</li>\n</ul><p><strong>AWARDS</strong></p><ul>\n<li>The Selfridges Beauty Awards 2020, <i>Hair Hero</i>\n</li>\n<li>Harper’s Bazaar 2020, Top 10 Hair Winners</li>\n<li>Harper’s Bazaar 2019, Hair Awards</li>\n<li>Marie Claire Hair Awards 2018, <i>Best Intensive Hair Mask</i>\n</li>\n<li>Vogue Beauty Awards 2017, <i>Best of Haircare and Hairstyling</i>\n</li>\n<li>Allure Beauty Breakthrough Awards 2014,<i> Conditioner for Treated Hair</i>\n</li>\n<li>Cult Beauty’s Hall of Fame, <i>Hair Treatment</i>\n</li>\n<li>PopSugar Beauty Awards, <i>Best Hair Hall of Famer</i>\n</li>\n<li>Best of Beauty, Global Beauty Award</li>\n<li>Elite Daily, Best Products for Dry, Frizzy Hair, <i>The Best Treatment</i>\n</li>\n</ul>",
            "title_2": "How To Use",
            "raw_content_2": "<ol>\n<li>In the shower, apply generously to wet hair from roots to ends. </li>\n<li>Leave on for 3 minutes. Rinse. </li>\n<li>Rinse from hair, shampoo, and condition.</li>\n</ol><p>For best results, use every 1-3 washes. Can be used daily if desired.</p>",
            "title_3": "Ingredients",
            "raw_content_3": "<p><strong>KEY INGREDIENTS</strong></p><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Natural Humectant Derived From L-Glutamic Acid</strong> - Improves manageability and infuses moisture.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Crambe Abyssinica Seed Oil, Avocado Oil + Sunflower Seed Oil </strong>-<strong> </strong>Reduces frizz and flyaways, and improves smoothness.</li>\n</ul><p><strong>FULL INGREDIENTS</strong><br>Aqua (Water, Eau), Cetearyl Alcohol, Behentrimonium Methosulfate, Bis-Aminopropyl Diglycol Dimaleate, Hydroxypropyl Starch Phosphate, Propanediol, Distearyldimonium Chloride, Glycerin, Behentrimonium Chloride, Cetyl Alcohol, Stearyl Alcohol, Caesalpinia Spinosa Fruit Pod Extract, Panthenol, Butyrospermum Parkii (Shea) Butter, Crambe Abyssinica Seed Oil, Helianthus Annuus (Sunflower) Extract, Persea Gratissima (Avocado) Oil, Cocos Nucifera (Coconut) Oil, Helianthus Annuus (Sunflower) Seed Oil, Quaternium-91, Oryza Sativa (Rice) Bran Extract, Caprylic/Capric Triglyceride, Ethylhexylglycerin, Hydroxypropyl Guar Hydroxypropyltrimonium Chloride, Rosmarinus Officinalis (Rosemary) Leaf Extract, Tocopherol, Helianthus Annuus (Sunflower) Sprout Extract, Caprylyl Glycol, Cetrimonium Chloride, Sodium PCA, Polyhydroxystearic Acid, Polyester-37, Ethyl Linoleate, Ethyl Oleate, Cetrimonium Methosulfate, Isopropyl Alcohol, Propylene Glycol, C13-15 Alkane, Guar Hydroxypropyltrimonium Chloride, Pentaerythrityl Tetra-di-t-butyl Hydroxyhydrocinnamate, Acrylamidopropyltrimonium Chloride/Acrylamide Copolymer, Phenethyl Benzoate, Sodium Bisulfite, Trisodium Ethylenediamine Disuccinate, Sodium Metabisulfite, Citric Acid, Phenoxyethanol, Sodium Benzoate, Parfum (Fragrance), Linalyl Acetate, Linalool, Hydroxycitronellal, Alpha-Isomethyl Ionone, Citronellol, CI 19140 (Yellow 5), CI 15985 (Yellow 6).</p>",
            "title_4": "",
            "raw_content_4": "",
            "title_5": "",
            "raw_content_5": ""
          }
        },
